sequenceDiagram
    participant Injector as Injector
    participant VU as Virtual User
    participant Feeder as Feeder
    participant Session as Session
    participant Auth as TokenProvider
    participant SUT as Target GraphQL API

    Note over Injector,SUT: RampageSimulation.before - start OAuth TokenRefresher if configured, write run metadata

    Injector->>VU: Spawn virtual user per workload profile
    Note over Injector: Open model uses arrival rate. Closed model uses fixed concurrency

    loop For each virtual user

        Feeder-->>Session: Inject one row as session attributes
        VU->>Auth: currentToken
        Auth-->>Session: Set authToken
        Note over Session: Also set correlationId as a fresh UUID

        opt Before-request pause configured
            VU->>VU: Pause before request
        end

        VU->>+SUT: POST /endpointRef with JSON body containing query and variables
        Note over VU,SUT: Authorization Bearer authToken and correlation-id header with correlationId value

        SUT-->>-VU: HTTP response with GraphQL JSON

        Note over VU: Checks run - status 200 and JSONPath extractions saved back to Session

        opt After-request pause configured
            VU->>VU: Pause after request
        end

        opt Scenario has additional steps
            Note over VU,SUT: Chain repeats for each step reusing the same Session
        end

    end

    Note over Auth: TokenRefresher periodically calls fetchToken to keep authToken fresh in OAuth mode

    Note over Injector,SUT: RampageSimulation.after - close streaming feeders and datasource pool. Evaluate global assertions p95 p99 and error-rate. Write HTML report and run-metadata.json
